<title>FRANCE: Scor sees no impact on results from fire.</title>
<headline>Scor sees no impact on results from fire.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French re-insurance group SCOR said in a statement that the net costs of a fire in the cross-Channel rail tunnel operated by Eurotunnel SA/Plc would be several million francs and would have no impact on the expected results for 1996.</p>
</text>
